<p>This site presents my work, services and articles. When you visit, GitHub Pages and its delivery network process connection information such as IP address and requested URLs to serve pages and keep the service secure.</p>
<h2>Messages and analytics</h2>
<p>When you email me or use the contact form once it is enabled, I use your name, email address, selected subject and message to respond and follow up. Please leave out sensitive information that is unrelated to your enquiry. Optional Google Analytics measures page visits and interactions only after you allow it. Form contents are kept out of analytics events. Fonts are served locally on the pages covered by this policy update. The preserved English blog index still loads Google Fonts.</p>
<h2>Retention and service providers</h2>
<p>Your analytics choice is respected for 180 days. Google Analytics data retention depends on the property's settings. Correspondence is kept for as long as needed to handle the enquiry or meet applicable obligations. GitHub Pages, the email provider, Google Analytics when enabled and the form provider after activation may process data as needed to deliver their services.</p>
<h2>Contact and choices</h2>
<p>Mustafa Anıl Aşlakcı is the data controller. Postal address: {{ siteFeatures['site-contact'].controllerAddress | escape }}. Rights requests: {{ siteFeatures['site-contact'].applicationEmail | escape }}.</p>
<p>For legal grounds, recipients and your rights, see the <a href="/en/kvkk-disclosure/">KVKK disclosure</a>. The <a href="/en/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a> explains how to change your choice.</p>
